      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "JIMMY JAMES MAGUIRE NZ (7) is two from two at this venue since switching from Queensland to the Josh Farrugia yard. Came from this row to score in this grade two back then made a long searching run to salute by 1.1 metres over this distance last week. Big chance to land the hat trick. ACTION MAJOR NZ (1) won at Newcastle when resuming two runs ago before coming from wider for a midfield finish at his latest appearance at Menangle. Should get every chance from the ace draw. MAURLEN BOY (6) has a consistent record at this circuit and distance and returns with some decent form from Menangle, beaten 3.4m last time out and placing at Listed level last month. WITHDISTINCTION (4) is another that looks suited here after racing wide at Menangle of late, highlighted by a close second from a wider barrier two back.",
